                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f9d4693-b503-3cec-b3ed-305daff60fd0",
                        "entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного непристойный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c42580a-b2e7-4fd2-9fd2-778e5a61927a",
                                "sense_id": "1f9d4693-b503-3cec-b3ed-305daff60fd0",
                                "text": "Непристойность замечания."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3de3e83-febd-3eb1-abf4-e01f27cf6a82",
                        "entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "glosses": [
                            "непристойное слово, жест, поступок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d2a3c58-d198-4f8b-bf1f-479385a3a97e",
                                "sense_id": "e3de3e83-febd-3eb1-abf4-e01f27cf6a82",
                                "text": "[Женщины] стали громко смеяться, говорить непристойности и тащить нас к столу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "462fdd81-fd94-40e2-bb9c-b9c1dc25b2a0",
                                "sense_id": "e3de3e83-febd-3eb1-abf4-e01f27cf6a82",
                                "text": "Де Визе сообщил, что его просто огорчает то обилие непристойностей, которое есть в комедии."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f10623b8-b711-4c3a-8333-7ca8cc8ee138",
                                "sense_id": "e3de3e83-febd-3eb1-abf4-e01f27cf6a82",
                                "text": "В газетах и по телевидению всё время рассказывают о том, как какой-нибудь депутат то обзовёт своего коллегу неприличным словом, то иную непристойность скажет…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bdd553e-0cd7-46ba-bfe8-274d81190bea",
                                "sense_id": "e3de3e83-febd-3eb1-abf4-e01f27cf6a82",
                                "text": "Большой палец, вскинутый вверх, будет расценен как непристойность в Иране, Ираке, Афганистане и Нигерии."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7cfce792-00fd-4c9e-9726-4e414e7d597a",
                        "source_entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "source_sense_description": "свойство по значению прилагательного непристойный",
                        "target_lang_word": "obscenity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obscenity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ada05fa6-323a-3a39-93c0-bb856e2160fa",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9842b-8ae1-30ad-a560-5660b00a15a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is obscene."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bd5081a-97d4-4bab-a763-194aeec9c6e0",
                                                "sense_id": "ada05fa6-323a-3a39-93c0-bb856e2160fa",
                                                "text": "Martha wouldn't go into the art museum because, as she put it, \"They have obscenities just sitting out, on display!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dcd21ca-c5f4-3736-b83b-c19140729ec6",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9842b-8ae1-30ad-a560-5660b00a15a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of obscene behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0efa4aa7-fb6e-4ce7-9e19-388570266a90",
                                                "sense_id": "9dcd21ca-c5f4-3736-b83b-c19140729ec6",
                                                "text": "Bestiality was outlawed as an obscenity in the strongly conservative community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "055ccf5a-2226-3ec5-a32b-b866374644e8",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9842b-8ae1-30ad-a560-5660b00a15a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Specifically, an offensive word; a profanity; a dirty word."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "746667c9-4c36-40a5-9868-349e4d8f6726",
                                                "sense_id": "055ccf5a-2226-3ec5-a32b-b866374644e8",
                                                "text": "Eliza couldn't stand her daughter's music; as she saw it, it was just shouted obscenities and a heavy drum beat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cc76525-d12e-49d3-a046-bd8dabfac4e1",
                                                "sense_id": "055ccf5a-2226-3ec5-a32b-b866374644e8",
                                                "text": "Her mother favored a multiyear project: obscenities carved in intricate and clever juxtapositions, descending every finger, curling in lettered whorls across the palm, fanning in offensive rays across the opisthenar, which is the name for the back of the hand, a word that Leilani knew because she had studied the structure of the human hand in detail, the better to understand her difference."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "256c2e2d-ec83-337d-8cb4-d332ea03a914",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9842b-8ae1-30ad-a560-5660b00a15a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lewdness, indecency, or offensive behaviour or material."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40b16a30-1088-4708-85b4-cce64e4c736e",
                                                "sense_id": "256c2e2d-ec83-337d-8cb4-d332ea03a914",
                                                "text": "The coalition of religious conservatives was campaigning against, in their view, rampant obscenity in the entertainment industry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fa5001d-247a-455f-bdf9-c3caa52d39a2",
                                                "sense_id": "256c2e2d-ec83-337d-8cb4-d332ea03a914",
                                                "text": "Over three and a half decades, \"Deep Throat\" has been damned by religious groups, decried by feminists, defended by First Amendment advocates, derided by critics and debated by social scientists. It dragged for years through local and federal courts around the country in a welter of obscenity trials in which it was variously banned, unbanned and rebanned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d83bc206-78d5-3de4-8c34-7ac8a9241582",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b9842b-8ae1-30ad-a560-5660b00a15a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact of being obscene."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d8d526d-913e-4479-a442-33fc8f4354be",
                                                "sense_id": "d83bc206-78d5-3de4-8c34-7ac8a9241582",
                                                "text": "Henia Flint Goodman, a Holocaust survivor,spoke in outrage against the obscenity of anti-abortion literature which compares a woman's free choice to have an abortion with the crimes of the Nazi state."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c2c2a99-2746-4015-974b-0fc68dc2a769",
                        "source_entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "source_sense_description": "свойство по значению прилагательного непристойный",
                        "target_lang_word": "indécence",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indécence",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec5616c3-c13d-3733-a643-ee12f72c4d56",
                                        "entry_id": "a541171e-0f6c-31e4-a8c1-27e2d301f396",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère de ce qui est indécent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "467ce63e-6fe1-433b-bea8-5d7d64ce70dc",
                                                "sense_id": "ec5616c3-c13d-3733-a643-ee12f72c4d56",
                                                "text": "Il y a de l’indécence dans sa tenue, dans ses propos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68e86cb5-2a5a-3d92-acdd-5aa9a0ba3cf6",
                                        "entry_id": "a541171e-0f6c-31e4-a8c1-27e2d301f396",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action ou propos indécent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa8141f8-4879-476e-a448-34451aa6b37d",
                                                "sense_id": "68e86cb5-2a5a-3d92-acdd-5aa9a0ba3cf6",
                                                "text": "Cette imagerie, désormais triomphante, […] ne laisse rien à deviner. Elle est franchement pornographique. Les petites polissonneries du siècle dernier semblent florianesques à côté d'une aussi grosse indécence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b81c54e-6247-4003-8033-4ff1878ee560",
                                                "sense_id": "68e86cb5-2a5a-3d92-acdd-5aa9a0ba3cf6",
                                                "text": "Le chanoine se couvrit le visage d’une de ses mains.\n— Excusez-moi, mon père, dit Zénon. Non decet. Je ne commettrai plus l’indécence qui consiste à essayer de montrer les choses comme elles sont."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a450f6a-becb-4c53-8dca-695a4fe2cea4",
                        "source_entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "source_sense_description": "свойство по значению прилагательного непристойный",
                        "target_lang_word": "gravelure",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gravelure",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f59d2090-8113-3ac7-9b03-32f0351ce129",
                                        "entry_id": "8ed74380-149b-3aa9-bfcc-f6b0bdb3224f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propos, discours licencieux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "642cfa37-509a-457b-bc58-ba655668d27a",
                                                "sense_id": "f59d2090-8113-3ac7-9b03-32f0351ce129",
                                                "text": "Il y a bien des gravelures dans ce vaudeville."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db1ee286-ce22-4315-8d4f-853ac3b57e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "f59d2090-8113-3ac7-9b03-32f0351ce129",
                                                "text": "Puis elle se retraça d’autres jours plus sérieux, où, initiée par sa mère à de mystérieuses pensées, elle s’était éloignée des folles bergères qui se réunissaient pour conjurer la peur et pour chanter des refrains assez lestes, gravelures rustiques qui sont marquées, air et paroles, au coin du dix-huitième siècle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "235ee99f-8498-4060-86f0-08b1cd5d67b1",
                                                "sense_id": "f59d2090-8113-3ac7-9b03-32f0351ce129",
                                                "text": "Protégé par cette pure tendresse contre les gravelures de certains contes du dix-huitième siècle qui lui tombèrent entre les mains, il se plut surtout à s’enfermer avec elle dans les utopies humanitaires que de grands esprits, affolés par la chimère du bonheur universel, ont rêvées de nos jours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "541d0744-d4ce-4f21-b4a8-2a25c31ef800",
                                                "sense_id": "f59d2090-8113-3ac7-9b03-32f0351ce129",
                                                "text": "Dans la partie verbale des tendances pareilles ont pour signe l’emploi de la gravelure et du calembour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e09403f-2ebe-4920-b03f-652b23099024",
                        "source_entry_id": "a41bd8bc-ce8a-36d1-a783-3b18d9827381",
                        "source_sense_description": "свойство по значению прилагательного непристойный",
                        "target_lang_word": "obscénité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obscénité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e993910-eebd-36c9-b0cc-50de142a0cfc",
                                        "entry_id": "945e189d-dea4-3c14-a181-531f2e5d1af6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère de ce qui est obscène."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b37b674-0979-45d3-9608-80ae8e38c568",
                                                "sense_id": "7e993910-eebd-36c9-b0cc-50de142a0cfc",
                                                "text": "C'était dans une longue salle basse […] dont les murs blanchis à la chaux étaient couverts d’inscriptions et de dessins, la plupart d’une obscénité brutale, œuvre des clients."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54fcac35-8ca5-4a25-998b-a18a1b57b6d8",
                                                "sense_id": "7e993910-eebd-36c9-b0cc-50de142a0cfc",
                                                "text": "Exactement. Avant d'être une industrie masturbatoire, la pornographie est l'art de montrer ce qui est obscène. […]. À force de représenter l’obscénité, on la banalise et on finit par l'admettre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af0196cd-9a5d-3ef6-bb0c-2c90844e73c6",
                                        "entry_id": "945e189d-dea4-3c14-a181-531f2e5d1af6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout ce qui a un caractère obscène."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a036fd4-a37e-4dce-9d7f-9252138985e9",
                                                "sense_id": "af0196cd-9a5d-3ef6-bb0c-2c90844e73c6",
                                                "text": "Je ne suis pas collet-monté, tant s’en faut, mais j'avoue, à ma honte, que les obscénités me déplaisent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87788d2a-dfaa-4bc9-8727-7840378770ac",
                                                "sense_id": "af0196cd-9a5d-3ef6-bb0c-2c90844e73c6",
                                                "text": "J’allai chez Olympe, que je trouvai essayant des robes, et qui, lorsque nous fûmes seuls, me chanta des obscénités pour me distraire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
